{"id":1120501,"chapter_id":1120501,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"广场黑环事件2周后 \n MBCC局长办公室","style":13,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501002,"trial_step":2},{"step":2,"content":"她的伤势怎么样了。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501003,"trial_step":3},{"step":3,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"中度脑震荡、开放性外伤、多处骨折……医疗部门尽力了，但还是不容乐观。","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501004,"trial_step":4},{"step":4,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"赫罗目前只能进行简单的活动，想要将她投入战斗则至少还需要一个月的静养治疗。","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501005,"trial_step":5},{"step":5,"content":"MBCC还不至于逼着重伤员战斗。不过，我还有些事情需要找她确认。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501006,"trial_step":6},{"step":6,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"您是指……","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501007,"trial_step":7},{"step":7,"content":"嗯，军团的事。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501008,"trial_step":8},{"step":8,"content":"治安局这些天的反扑很不正常，完全超出了报复性袭击的范畴。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501009,"trial_step":9},{"step":9,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"的确，他们更像是在寻找某样东西。","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501010,"trial_step":10},{"step":10,"content":"军团是以保护伤员的理由将赫罗送来的。但事情恐怕没那么简单。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501011,"trial_step":11},{"step":11,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"……我明白了。","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501012,"trial_step":12},{"step":12,"content":"夜莺打开了耳麦。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501013,"trial_step":13},{"step":13,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"通知医疗部门，把赫罗带去审查室……","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501014,"trial_step":14},{"step":14,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"嗯，尽快……","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501015,"trial_step":15},{"step":15,"content":"赫罗的身上缠着干净的纱布。审查室里氤氲着外用抗生素的味道。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501017,"trial_step":17,"drawing":1120501},{"step":16,"options":["询问赫罗身体状况","直接开始提问"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501018,"trial_step":18,"course":3,"drawing":1120501,"choices":[{"text":"询问赫罗身体状况","goto":19},{"text":"直接开始提问","goto":23}]},{"step":17,"content":"你的伤势怎么样了？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1120501},{"step":18,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"没什么大碍。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1120501},{"step":19,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"你的人帮了我……谢谢。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501021,"trial_step":21,"drawing":1120501},{"step":20,"content":"即便赫罗身体和精神状态如此糟糕，她还是在强撑着与你对话。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1120501,"next":[24]},{"step":21,"content":"赫罗的伤势不容乐观，亟需静养，应该快速切入正题以减轻她的负担。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1120501},{"step":22,"content":"别紧张，赫罗。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1120501},{"step":23,"content":"是军团将你送到了这里。在解决威胁之前，MBCC会负责保护你的安全。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501025,"trial_step":25,"drawing":1120501},{"step":24,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"我知道。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1120501},{"step":25,"content":"好，我会问一些问题。请你如实回答。这关乎到你和军团的安全。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1120501},{"step":26,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1120501},{"step":27,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"嗯。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1120501},{"step":28,"content":"赫罗的状态有些反常。至少在过去的接触中，她不是这种会乖乖配合的性格。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1120501},{"step":29,"content":"或许她现在没有体力反抗，又或许，卓娅的失踪和厄尔希的死亡给她带去了太过沉重的打击。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1120501},{"step":30,"content":"无论是哪种原因，这场审查都不该持续太久。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1120501},{"step":31,"options":["你是何时加入军团的？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501033,"trial_step":33,"course":3,"drawing":1120501,"choices":[{"text":"你是何时加入军团的？","goto":34}]},{"step":32,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"8年前的4月21日，我和厄尔希加入了涅槃运输队。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1120501},{"step":33,"content":"你对照着手中的资料：8年前还没有“军团”，那个后来令所有黑帮闻风丧胆的组织，名义上还是涅槃集团下属的物流公司。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1120501},{"step":34,"content":"你们在那里做些什么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1120501},{"step":35,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"厄尔希最初在卸货区工作，我……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1120501},{"step":36,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"我什么都没有做。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1120501},{"step":37,"content":"你快速在笔记本上记录下这些信息。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1120501},{"step":38,"content":"你知道卓娅的去向吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1120501},{"step":39,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"卓娅老大？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1120501},{"step":40,"content":"赫罗的声音略微有些诧异，但又很快低下头。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1120502},{"step":41,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"……我不知道。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1120502},{"step":42,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"两周前，我们分别之后，我就一直在军团的据点养伤。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1120502},{"step":43,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"自那之后，我再没见到过她。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1120502},{"step":44,"content":"笔尖在纸上划过，沙沙作响。气氛异常压抑。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1120502},{"step":45,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"${PlayerName}……局长。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1120503},{"step":46,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"能告诉我……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1120503},{"step":47,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"军团现在怎么样了吗？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1120503},{"step":48,"content":"你听到了她的问题。你没有停止手上的信息记录，简短地回答了她。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1120503},{"step":49,"content":"广场事件中，卓娅的受骸进程被厄尔希强行终止。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1120503},{"step":50,"content":"厄尔希代替卓娅成为受骸者而死，卓娅则伤重失踪。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1120503},{"step":51,"content":"失去了作为主要战力的禁闭者，军团的处境有些艰难。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1120503},{"step":52,"content":"面对治安局的反扑，他们暂时只能留在固定据点内防守……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1120503},{"step":53,"content":"你抬起头，发觉赫罗的双眼失焦，脸色极为苍白。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1120501},{"step":54,"content":"赫罗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1120501},{"step":55,"content":"你没事吧？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1120501},{"step":56,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"我……我没事……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1120501},{"step":57,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"我只是……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1120501},{"step":58,"content":"赫罗的呼吸迟滞，就连发出声音都变得困难。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1120501},{"step":59,"content":"过了很久，她的气息才平复下来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1120502},{"step":60,"content":"等等，你是第一次知道这些吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1120502},{"step":61,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"嗯。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1120502},{"step":62,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"大家只是说……辛迪加局势很乱，大姐头和厄尔希还在战斗……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1120502},{"step":63,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"其实我早就知道的，我早就知道的……厄尔希他毕竟是我的……哥哥。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501065,"trial_step":65,"drawing":1120502},{"step":64,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"我只是……需要花点时间来接受。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501066,"trial_step":66,"drawing":1120501},{"step":65,"content":"赫罗努力让她的表情变得平静，但声音中的情绪还是出卖了她。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501067,"trial_step":67,"drawing":1120501},{"step":66,"options":["安抚赫罗"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501068,"trial_step":68,"course":3,"drawing":1120501,"choices":[{"text":"安抚赫罗","goto":69}]},{"step":67,"content":"不用担心，至少在这里，没人能威胁到你的安全。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1120501},{"step":68,"content":"军团不会有问题的，他们很强大。这一点你是最了解的，不是吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1120501},{"step":69,"content":"你的安慰有些苍白。但赫罗还是对你露出了一个勉强的笑容。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501071,"trial_step":71,"drawing":1120501},{"step":70,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"谢谢你，${PlayerName}。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501072,"trial_step":72,"drawing":1120502},{"step":71,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"但我不是小孩子……你不用这样安慰我。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1120502},{"step":72,"content":"赫罗握紧了拳头，淡淡的红色印迹浮现在洁白的纱布上。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501074,"trial_step":74,"drawing":1120503},{"step":73,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"军团现在很危险，对嘛？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1120503},{"step":74,"content":"看着赫罗的双眼，你叹了口气。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1120503},{"step":75,"content":"的确，军团现在面临的处境相当艰难。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1120503},{"step":76,"content":"造成奇兰广场一系列事件的首恶已死，但他所代表的利益团体还没有放弃挣扎。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1120503},{"step":77,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"你们不能阻止他们吗？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501079,"trial_step":79,"drawing":1120503},{"step":78,"content":"广场黑环爆发之后，FAC损失了大量人手。后续的救援和污染清理工作已经令他们分身乏术。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1120503},{"step":79,"content":"更不用提黑环爆发的直接诱因，受骸者是……厄尔希。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1120503},{"step":80,"content":"第九机关在没有明确证据之前不会轻易动手，而MBCC，缺乏与治安局和市议会正面对抗的力量。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1120503},{"step":81,"content":"我答应过卓娅，会帮助军团。但截至目前，我能做的事情相当有限。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501083,"trial_step":83,"drawing":1120503},{"step":82,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1120503},{"step":83,"content":"不过，事情并非没有转机。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1120503},{"step":84,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":86,"course":6,"drawing":1120503},{"step":85,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":86,"course":6,"drawing":1120503},{"step":86,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":86,"course":6,"drawing":1120503},{"step":87,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":86,"course":6,"drawing":1120503},{"step":88,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":86,"course":6,"drawing":1120503},{"step":89,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":86,"course":6,"drawing":1120503},{"step":90,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":86,"course":6,"drawing":1120503},{"step":91,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":86,"course":6,"drawing":1120503},{"step":92,"content":"治安局的残余势力流窜辛迪加各地，袭击军团据点。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1120503},{"step":93,"content":"值得注意的是，他们的目的似乎并非“报复”。在攻破数个军团据点后，他们没有选择追击，而是进入其中大肆搜查。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1120503},{"step":94,"content":"他们在寻找某样东西，或者说，某个人。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1120503},{"step":95,"content":"你的视线重新落回到赫罗的身上。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1120503},{"step":96,"content":"我认为，他们在寻找你，赫罗。治安局铤而走险攻击军团，为的就是找到你。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1120503},{"step":97,"content":"你是不是知道什么情报，某个让整个治安局都恐惧的情报？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501092,"trial_step":92,"drawing":1120503},{"step":98,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501093,"trial_step":93,"drawing":1120502},{"step":99,"content":"赫罗低下头。思索的时间并不长。片刻之后，她给出了答案。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501094,"trial_step":94,"drawing":1120502},{"step":100,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"几个月前，我被治安局抓到过。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501095,"trial_step":95,"drawing":1120502},{"step":101,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"我听到几个自称“帕尔马”的人和他们交易狂厄武器。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501096,"trial_step":96,"drawing":1120502},{"step":102,"content":"人员身份和交易明细，这些你知道吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501097,"trial_step":97,"drawing":1120502},{"step":103,"content":"赫罗摇了摇头。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501098,"trial_step":98,"drawing":1120502},{"step":104,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"对不起。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501099,"trial_step":99,"drawing":1120502},{"step":105,"content":"不用道歉。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501100,"trial_step":100,"drawing":1120502},{"step":106,"content":"即便缺乏细节证据，但这一情报指明了治安局的动机。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501101,"trial_step":101,"drawing":1120502},{"step":107,"content":"如果确认属实，足以拉第九机关入场——这也意味着事情可以得到彻底的解决。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501102,"trial_step":102,"drawing":1120502},{"step":108,"content":"有什么证据可以证明你的说法吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501103,"trial_step":103,"drawing":1120502},{"step":109,"content":"甚至不用是证据，只要能缩小调查范围，确定可能参与帕尔马交易的目标就可以。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501104,"trial_step":104,"drawing":1120502},{"step":110,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501105,"trial_step":105,"drawing":1120503},{"step":111,"content":"仔细回想一下，赫罗。这很重要。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501106,"trial_step":106,"drawing":1120503},{"step":112,"content":"这次回忆的时间颇为漫长，气氛安静得有些压抑。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501107,"trial_step":107,"drawing":1120503},{"step":113,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"……厄尔希。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501108,"trial_step":108,"drawing":1120503},{"step":114,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"厄尔希一直在收集军团敌对势力的情报。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501109,"trial_step":109,"drawing":1120503},{"step":115,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"他会详细记录那些人的身份。如果能看到，或许我……我一定能认出他们。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501110,"trial_step":110,"drawing":1120503},{"step":116,"content":"夜莺。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501111,"trial_step":111,"drawing":1120503},{"step":117,"content":"没有任何犹豫，你打开了通讯器。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501112,"trial_step":112,"drawing":1120503},{"step":118,"content":"联系军团的人，让他们把厄尔希过去收集的情报送出来。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501113,"trial_step":113,"drawing":1120503},{"step":119,"content":"不对，这个节点让军团的人送出情报太危险了……替我安排人手，我亲自去一趟。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501114,"trial_step":114,"drawing":1120503},{"step":120,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"明白。","style":11,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501115,"trial_step":115,"drawing":1120503},{"step":121,"content":"掐断通讯后，你迅速整理桌面上的文件，就要离开。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501116,"trial_step":116,"drawing":1120503},{"step":122,"content":"每拖延一会儿，军团面临的危机就更大一分。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501117,"trial_step":117,"drawing":1120503},{"step":123,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"你这样是找不到的。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501118,"trial_step":118,"drawing":1120503},{"step":124,"content":"赫罗的声音让你停止了手头的工作。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501119,"trial_step":119,"drawing":1120503},{"step":125,"content":"为什么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501120,"trial_step":120,"drawing":1120503},{"step":126,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"厄尔希他……很少信任别人。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501121,"trial_step":121,"drawing":1120503},{"step":127,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"他很谨慎，重要的情报会存放在更隐秘的地方。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501122,"trial_step":122,"drawing":1120503},{"step":128,"content":"军团的人也不知道在哪儿？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501123,"trial_step":123,"drawing":1120503},{"step":129,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"是的……我……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501124,"trial_step":124,"drawing":1120503},{"step":130,"content":"赫罗犹豫了一会儿，终于还是抬头看向你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501125,"trial_step":125,"drawing":1120504},{"step":131,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"让我一起去吧。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501126,"trial_step":126,"drawing":1120504},{"step":132,"content":"可你的身体……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501127,"trial_step":127,"drawing":1120504},{"step":133,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"没关系的。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501128,"trial_step":128,"drawing":1120504},{"step":134,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"不要小看我们禁闭者，正常的行动已经没问题了。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501129,"trial_step":129,"drawing":1120504},{"step":135,"content":"看着赫罗的坚定的眼神，你发现自己多少被说动了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501130,"trial_step":130,"drawing":1120504},{"step":136,"content":"辛迪加的情况复杂，如果仅仅是按图索骥，很可能会出现遗漏。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501131,"trial_step":131,"drawing":1120504},{"step":137,"content":"相反，让赫罗做向导，组建一支精锐小队秘密潜入，无疑会更加高效。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501132,"trial_step":132,"drawing":1120504},{"step":138,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501133,"trial_step":133,"drawing":1120504},{"step":139,"content":"你坚持要回去，是为了看看军团现在的状况吧？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501134,"trial_step":134,"drawing":1120504},{"step":140,"content":"赫罗并没有否认，只是沉默地低下头去。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501135,"trial_step":135,"drawing":1120504},{"step":141,"content":"自从来到MBCC，她变了许多。与当初那个莽撞的少女判若两人。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501136,"trial_step":136,"drawing":1120504},{"step":142,"content":"军团的剧变给予了她太过沉重的打击，但这或许也让她以难以想象的速度成长了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501137,"trial_step":137,"drawing":1120504},{"step":143,"content":"我知道了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501138,"trial_step":138,"drawing":1120504},{"step":144,"content":"严格遵照医嘱接受治疗，尽可能恢复身体。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501139,"trial_step":139,"drawing":1120504},{"step":145,"content":"这次行动没有“伤患”的位置。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501140,"trial_step":140,"drawing":1120504},{"step":146,"speaker":"赫罗","content":"嗯。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501141,"trial_step":141,"drawing":1120504},{"step":147,"content":"面对你严苛到有些刻薄的要求，赫罗没有露出任何不满的表情，只是重重点了点头。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":220501142,"trial_step":142,"drawing":1120504}]}